<title>UK: Toyota to launch $1.0 bln Euro-Asian bond.</title>
<headline>Toyota to launch $1.0 bln Euro-Asian bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp has mandated Credit Suisse First Boston and Merrill Lynch to underwrite a $1.0 billion Euro-Asian bond, Merrill said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Timing and final details would be subject to market conditions, the statement said. The deal will be listed in London, Hong Kong and Singapore.  </p>
<p>Bankers away from the lead managers said the deal could come be launched as early as July 15, and a five-year maturity was expected.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
